                                "text": "Hence \"public rites,\" \"the rites of the Roman people,\" those rites conducted by magistrates, were performed on behalf of the citizen body as a whole, and, as a corollary, all citizens as individuals were understood to assent to those rites and, by synecdochic representation, to participate in them."
